[DATA] at least one items[] entry has non-empty fullName and non-empty emails[] (SR_REP_PRIMARY, who serves ORG_ACME) {DOC}
[DATA] every items[] entry has a non-empty GUID id {DOC}

[ERRORS] (page1) errors[] empty {DOC}
[DATA] (page1) pageInfo.hasNextPage = true {DOC}
[COUNT] (page1) items.length = 2 {DOC}
[ERRORS] (page2) errors[] empty {DOC}
[DATA] (page2) items[] contains no id present in (page1) items[] (no cross-page overlap) {DOC}

[ERRORS] errors[] empty {DOC}
[DATA] data.customerSalesReps.totalCount >= 1 {DOC}
[DATA] every items[].fullName contains the keyword substring (case-insensitive) {DOC}

[ERRORS] (asc) errors[] empty {DOC}
[ERRORS] (desc) errors[] empty {DOC}
[DATA] (asc) items.0.fullName != (desc) items.0.fullName — the two sort directions surface different first items when >=2 distinct-named reps exist {DOC}

